Why This Works

✅ Handles Multiline Cells → Merges newlines within cells.
✅ Uses PyMuPDF (fitz) for Accurate Text Positioning → Ensures correct cell mapping.
✅ Ensures Proper Table Structure → Prevents broken rows.

